 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31683",
   "off": 202371,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "リスプ\r「７才の時に医療聖堂長の\r  手術により",
   "en": "Risp\r\"When I was seven, in an operation by the High Priest of Medicine,",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:316b5",
   "off": 202421,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:316b8",
   "off": 202424,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  私達の体は\r  切り離されました",
   "en": "our bodies were separated.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:316dd",
   "off": 202461,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:316e0",
   "off": 202464,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  けれど… 完全な身体を\r  得たのは姉の私だけ…",
   "en": "But... only I, the elder sister, was given a whole body...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31714",
   "off": 202516,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31717",
   "off": 202519,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  妹は体のほとんどを\r  失いました",
   "en": "My younger sister lost almost all of hers.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3173e",
   "off": 202558,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31741",
   "off": 202561,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  私のこの体の半分は\r  キラルのものだった\r  のです」",
   "en": "Half of this body of mine... once belonged to Kiral.\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31781",
   "off": 202625,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31784",
   "off": 202628,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "リスプ\r「もう､キラルは医療聖堂の",
   "en": "Risp\r\"Kiral can no longer live without the Temple of Medicine's",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:317aa",
   "off": 202666,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:317ad",
   "off": 202669,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  装置なしには生きられま\r  せん",
   "en": "machines.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:317d2",
   "off": 202706,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:317d9",
   "off": 202713,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  だから…",
   "en": "That is why...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:317e9",
   "off": 202729,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:317ec",
   "off": 202732,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  妹が､王国の娘として\r  人々に愛される",
   "en": "seeing my sister loved by the people as the Daughter of the Kingdom...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31818",
   "off": 202776,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3181b",
   "off": 202779,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  それが 何よりもうれし\r  かった」",
   "en": "made me happier than anything.\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31844",
   "off": 202820,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3184d",
   "off": 202829,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "司祭長\r「王国の娘の資格を持つ者\r  だけが",
   "en": "High Priest\r\"Only one with the right to be Daughter of the Kingdom",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3187b",
   "off": 202875,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3187e",
   "off": 202878,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  いにしえの知識を\r  世界にもたらす…",
   "en": "can bring the Ancient Knowledge to the world...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:318a9",
   "off": 202921,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:318b0",
   "off": 202928,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  この世界には まだ\r  王国の娘が必要なのだよ」",
   "en": "This world still needs a Daughter of the Kingdom.\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:318e6",
   "off": 202982,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:318ed",
   "off": 202989,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "司祭長\r「リスプとキラルの持つ\r  能力は",
   "en": "High Priest\r\"The power that Risp and Kiral possess...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31919",
   "off": 203033,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3191c",
   "off": 203036,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  もう 君たちも\r  知っているだろう",
   "en": "surely you know of it by now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31944",
   "off": 203076,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31947",
   "off": 203079,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  バウンダリーゲートを\r  操る力…",
   "en": "The power to control the Boundary Gate...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:3196e",
   "off": 203118,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:31971",
   "off": 203121,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  姉妹がそろえば\r  世界を自由にできる\r  ほどの力だ",
   "en": "Together, the sisters would have power enough to bend the world to their will.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:319a9",
   "off": 203177,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:319b0",
   "off": 203184,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  今 キラルによって\r  ねじ曲げられたゲートは\r  暴走寸前の状態にある",
   "en": "And now, twisted by Kiral, the Gate is on the brink of running wild.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:319f9",
   "off": 203257,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT68:319fc",
   "off": 203260,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  それを止められるのは…\r  リスプとキラルだけだ…」",
   "en": "The only ones who can stop it... are Risp and Kiral...\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
